 *WHACK!* The chest breaks open and rockets into the sky!\");\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        player.execute(`playsound ambient.weather.thunder @a`); // Play crash sound\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                // Agent falls out of the chest matrix\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    agent.move(SixDirection.Down, 1); \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        loops.pause(1200); \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                   